*.lock
*.lock.info

# Hugging Face Space: the model weights are a build ARTIFACT here, not source.
# trained_models/ is already tracked at the repo root; huggingface_space/ needs its own
# on-disk copy at docker-build time, but committing the same 19 MB of binaries a second
# time would double them in every clone FOREVER -- git keeps blobs even after a later
# delete, so this is only free to decide before the first commit.
# Regenerate with:  python huggingface_space/sync_shared.py --push
# sync_shared.py --check refuses to call the folder upload-ready without them.
huggingface_space/trained_models/

# Derived VRP frame. Rebuildable in ~1-2h with:
#   python -m trade_analysis.hpc.build_vrp_dataset --symbol SPY --out data/vrp
# Git keeps blobs forever, so 37 MB of regenerable parquet would sit in every clone
# permanently -- the same reason trained_models/ is ignored on the Space side.
data/vrp/
